      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Removed A = 9×7/12 = 21/4.\nRemoved B = 15/4.\n\nThen B gets the full 9 L replacement. If the final ratio is known, one equation in x reveals the original amounts.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
